    "body": "<!-- claude-projects-attribution: {\"github_login\":\"siainbuletin\"} -->\n_Requested by **Sia** · [project thread](https://claude.ai/code/project/chan_01KaQfLZaF43QUMN3kcT7pW2?thread=cmsg_01KaQfLZaF43QUMN3kcT7pW21jZfxe5AmskoMP3AYBnVbr)_\n\nStacked on #45 (merge #45 first and GitHub retargets this to `main`).\n\nBefore: the menu was a flat list (Agenda, Config, Mail, Notes, Projects) and `wawawewa` was centred on the window.\n\nAfter:\n- The menu is `sp-splash-menu`, a list of blocks, each drawn in a box of lines (`sp-splash-box-face`, inherits `shadow`) centred under the banner. Agenda is a block with nested rows: **General agenda** (`a`), **Thesis** (`t`), **Issues** (`i`), **Deadlines** (`d`). Config (`c`) and Notes (`n`) are single-row boxes.\n- Each agenda has a variable for its files: `sp-splash-agenda-general-files`, `-thesis-files`, `-issues-files`, `-deadlines-files`. While one is nil it uses `org-agenda-files`; General with nil keeps opening the agenda workspace. Deadlines shows only deadlines in the next `sp-splash-deadlines-days` (30).\n- Mail and Projects (rows, keys `m`/`p` and their commands) are removed.\n- `wawawewa` is italic and centred on the lambda (`sp-splash-footer-layer`), so it sits near the art.\n- `sp-splash.org` updated in step (new \"Splash menu\" section, agendas section); it tangles to the same text as the `.el`. CHANGELOG entry added.\n\nNot in this PR: the sidebar for writing projects and the issue tracker (own thread), and the theme colour framework (next PR).\n\nChecked in headless Emacs 29.3 (200x50, `nerd-icons-faicon` stubbed): three boxes under the banner with the nested agenda, footer under the lambda, and the deadlines command listed a test deadline 3 days ahead. Not checked: a real GUI frame with nerd icons and your fonts (box characters need a font with box drawing).\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01T2BcMQ3qdNUiW5oZRLQRsG",
